        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last heir of a cursed bloodline. At the moment of your death, your soul is destined for hell—unless you uncover the truth behind your ancestor’s betrayal and rewrite your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a forsaken mansion, read painful diaries, and solve intricate puzzles to gather fragments of forgotten memories. These will grant you access to the mysterious Gallery of Souls, where the secrets of your dynasty await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey leads to the Black Chapel, where you must confront the devil himself and attempt to barter your ancestor’s soul for your own. Your choices shape the story, unlock occult powers, and determine which of the multiple endings you’ll face.</p>",
